    {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "text": "題目編號",
      "text_sha256": "e4d7d2f3a7a87e779cf69a59ce0d1bbe0d004f2d444852fb15edff7cc1955af7"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "text": "題目",
      "text_sha256": "f22631d0799b4f876549a90371fdb69f2ca2df6c554f09d13935ada2dfdc7309"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "text": "第七章節",
      "text_sha256": "cf441eb5c80269e4ef24ba1ef8630023aa3115067d0e883795d88110cdd98a54"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 4,
      "text": "",
      "text_sha256": "12ae32cb1ec02d01eda3581b127c1fee3b0dc53572ed6baf239721a03d82e126"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 5,
      "text": "001",
      "text_sha256": "a3feaa646c54c2326763b52932b8dca80a69cf44bb81d7293e4f1c913a54f77d"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 6,
      "text": "有一電阻R= 5Ω與電容抗XC =20Ω並聯，試問其阻抗Z=?",
      "text_sha256": "c524d016653123d89fb8c5149482e938209b9327f5c3c97fb3356606a10f3e4f"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 7,
      "text": "002",
      "text_sha256": "f3f2837c2b6669057a26306e8098ee05a18044658898e07528da159fd9a0f57f"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 8,
      "text": "有一交流電電路視在功率為5",
      "text_sha256": "78ab77d6fe74429632c174b1e057cd1f4fb83e1bbab2bbeda591a5a3770776f4"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 9,
      "text": "003",
      "text_sha256": "03b9fa4b773610c8a60262936d75446af0919271a730a90a5ea1d461130d3f42"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 10,
      "text": "有一交流正弦波以示波器測得知電壓的峰對峰直為200V，求此電壓的最大值及有效值分別為何?",
      "text_sha256": "f2f2cbbb764f379315644721f89b9a7c15c36b07e99ed982a7abfd5ea2d05d8e"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 11,
      "text": "004",
      "text_sha256": "df2ed63dd071cb3a6d47c8962f019d030c91e17406d9e57225da408ae7195c12"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 12,
      "text": "欲四極交流發電機，當轉速達1800rpm",
      "text_sha256": "dad6158960ddb48f7410df90f22b099a771e794d46901718cab3f204635f887f"
    },
